{
    "word": "frustum",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "a3701c0d-a280-317e-9f48-bf237707ee6d",
                "word": "frustum",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "1f701d96-edad-42da-b0a8-f3122d2ea414",
                        "entry_id": "a3701c0d-a280-317e-9f48-bf237707ee6d",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "frustums"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "b9617636-8bdc-4da8-9774-638bdc5b0ff5",
                        "entry_id": "a3701c0d-a280-317e-9f48-bf237707ee6d",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "frusta"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "872c7ae0-672e-3ee9-a509-2a52af371749",
                        "entry_id": "a3701c0d-a280-317e-9f48-bf237707ee6d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A cone or pyramid whose tip has been truncated by a plane parallel to its base."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c0ed0d10-d81a-4304-a779-88670a63555e",
                                "sense_id": "872c7ae0-672e-3ee9-a509-2a52af371749",
                                "text": "In a parabolic conoid this difference vaniſhes, the fruſtum being always equal to a cylinder of the ſame height upon the ſection of the conoid that biſects the altitude of the fruſtum and is parallel to its baſes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "152197c6-3de5-4e12-a002-10edfd354997",
                                "sense_id": "872c7ae0-672e-3ee9-a509-2a52af371749",
                                "text": "This theorem holds good for complete solids as well as frustums, whether right or oblique, and not only of the solids generated from the conic sections, but also of all pyramids, cones, and in short of any solid, whose parallel sections are similar figures."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4c22de23-9df7-4b64-b195-7e63a5cdce78",
                                "sense_id": "872c7ae0-672e-3ee9-a509-2a52af371749",
                                "text": "Come, every frustum longs to be a cone,\nAnd every vector dreams of matrices."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1e09480c-423e-4983-ab1d-dccaa5ac6919",
                                "sense_id": "872c7ae0-672e-3ee9-a509-2a52af371749",
                                "text": "2006, Pawan Harish Nirnimesh, P. J. Narayanan, Culling an Object Hierarchy to a Frustum Hierarchy, Prem Kalra, Shmuel Peleg (editors), Computer Vision, Graphics and Image Processing: 5th Indian Conference, ICVGIP 2006, Springer, LNCS4338, page 252,\nHowever, when there are multiple view frustums (as in a tiled display wall), visibility culling time becomes substantial and cannot be hidden by pipelining it with other stages of rendering."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1a2db7ef-b896-4134-ac08-07d84b05e42c",
                                "sense_id": "872c7ae0-672e-3ee9-a509-2a52af371749",
                                "text": "Here, the dynamics of the fluid-filled frusta of cones are considered (see Figure 5.5). The frusta are clamped at their roots and free at their ends."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ad91dde4-0411-3b16-88bb-f18293947896",
                        "entry_id": "a3701c0d-a280-317e-9f48-bf237707ee6d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A portion of a sphere, or in general any solid, delimited by two parallel planes."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1674716f-933a-4738-a810-e9730ad07aa3",
                                "sense_id": "ad91dde4-0411-3b16-88bb-f18293947896",
                                "text": "In some women it^([the os uteri]) is flat, in many more tuberose, and forming, as it were, a frustum of a sphere;[…]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8b6ad663-ae86-4904-b7d2-834766f9ef30",
                                "sense_id": "ad91dde4-0411-3b16-88bb-f18293947896",
                                "text": "Problem 22. Determine the volume of a frustum of a sphere of diameter 49.74 cm if the diameter^([sic]) of the ends of the frustum are 24.0 and 40.0 cm, and the height of the frustum is 7.00 cm."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8ce62a55-c7e3-4a6d-9dfd-0b280f2969b0",
                        "source_entry_id": "a3701c0d-a280-317e-9f48-bf237707ee6d",
                        "source_sense_description": "truncated cone or pyramid",
                        "target_lang_word": "tronc",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "tronc",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2f317c26-f37f-36b1-ac4f-0fe8e913bd99",
                                        "entry_id": "aa9a2e46-55f1-3592-a235-692e488379a5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Corps d’un arbre, tige considérée sans les branches."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Jardinage"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "967588fb-c108-4554-bf1a-3108b2e970c1",
                                                "sense_id": "2f317c26-f37f-36b1-ac4f-0fe8e913bd99",
                                                "text": "À l’arrivée des gendarmes, le sanglier chargeait toujours le tronc d’arbre."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3a50b674-90f5-4958-864f-b02d0c3b5fbd",
                                                "sense_id": "2f317c26-f37f-36b1-ac4f-0fe8e913bd99",
                                                "text": "On vient d’abattre à Lyon un platane géant. Cet arbre cubait près de 12 mètres et le tronc seul pesait 19540 kilogr."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7e6390e3-4f91-49a3-be08-fc25cc10572a",
                                                "sense_id": "2f317c26-f37f-36b1-ac4f-0fe8e913bd99",
                                                "text": "[…] et déjà nous accostions à l’estacade du bois de la Chaise, un bois de pins tristes et d’yeuses superbes, aux troncs tordus, au feuillage presque noir."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "40069e7b-d33b-4e24-bbd5-c54e97d1d72d",
                                                "sense_id": "2f317c26-f37f-36b1-ac4f-0fe8e913bd99",
                                                "text": "Constatez, docteur, la férocité inintelligente des propriétaires de cette forêt, voyez ces kilomètres d’abatis, sans un seul tronc debout…"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "816bf1f3-a3f5-3224-9b2d-1c6f4120cbe9",
                                        "entry_id": "aa9a2e46-55f1-3592-a235-692e488379a5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Origine, partie principale d’un vaisseau, d’un nerf."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fb455213-2ea2-4ab5-9f5f-f230f0d68acd",
                                                "sense_id": "816bf1f3-a3f5-3224-9b2d-1c6f4120cbe9",
                                                "text": "Le tronc d’une artère, d’une veine."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8a8184c2-a6d4-49be-8193-68e162cee13e",
                                                "sense_id": "816bf1f3-a3f5-3224-9b2d-1c6f4120cbe9",
                                                "text": "Tronc artériel, tronc veineux."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d3e5d2d6-8ed4-36a8-96d9-f819e8e64abd",
                                        "entry_id": "aa9a2e46-55f1-3592-a235-692e488379a5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Partie principale du corps d’un homme, d’un animal, sans la tête ni les membres."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d86d7e2e-cf2a-4aae-a69e-11ee5cd1ecc7",
                                                "sense_id": "d3e5d2d6-8ed4-36a8-96d9-f819e8e64abd",
                                                "text": "À ce tronc si court sont attachés des membres d’une longueur gigantesque : l’enjambée faite est ainsi profitable à une marche fort rapide […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4a9a1b5d-e78f-4ced-815c-bd558fa7d1a0",
                                                "sense_id": "d3e5d2d6-8ed4-36a8-96d9-f819e8e64abd",
                                                "text": "D’un coup de rasoir, je lui coupai la tête, et le tronc, d’où un flot de sang s’échappait, gigota quelques secondes sur le parquet."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1f555b6b-7db2-35fd-b56f-ed14a8d4489d",
                                        "entry_id": "aa9a2e46-55f1-3592-a235-692e488379a5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Partie comprise entre la base d’un cône, d’une pyramide, d’un prisme, et sa section par un plan."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fbdf5e1a-3419-462c-a773-73aae89ca5a6",
                                                "sense_id": "1f555b6b-7db2-35fd-b56f-ed14a8d4489d",
                                                "text": "Un tronc de cône, de pyramide."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "04436c4f-ce40-3055-83de-fe2b65e04899",
                                        "entry_id": "aa9a2e46-55f1-3592-a235-692e488379a5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Fragment d’un fût de colonne."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a961afad-7635-4fa7-9548-10d747b7ba29",
                                                "sense_id": "04436c4f-ce40-3055-83de-fe2b65e04899",
                                                "text": "Tronc de colonne,"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ba6a762d-4efe-3160-adec-9d8ae292f465",
                                        "entry_id": "aa9a2e46-55f1-3592-a235-692e488379a5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ligne directe des ascendants et des descendants, d’où partent les branches ou lignes collatérales."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de704ee1-dfe1-4485-93b1-975c7e15affa",
                                                "sense_id": "ba6a762d-4efe-3160-adec-9d8ae292f465",
                                                "text": "Ces deux familles sont de deux branches qui sortent du même tronc."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3c8c7df7-b889-3c2b-8834-f8a00342f2f7",
                                        "entry_id": "aa9a2e46-55f1-3592-a235-692e488379a5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Boîte, coffre de bois ou de métal posé ordinairement dans les églises et qui possède une fente pour recevoir l’argent des aumônes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2fe45f78-9508-49b0-968e-f23e6c54c4fc",
                                                "sense_id": "3c8c7df7-b889-3c2b-8834-f8a00342f2f7",
                                                "text": "Cependant le nommé Ignace Mélisse étoit accusé, le 26 mai, devant la cour d'assises de l'Ain, d'avoir volé, à l'aide d'une baguette imprégnée de glu , l'argent qui se trouvoit dans le tronc de l'église de Saint-André-de-Corcy."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "03fe3c1f-a7e0-4e8f-a674-0dab95f1ddfd",
                                                "sense_id": "3c8c7df7-b889-3c2b-8834-f8a00342f2f7",
                                                "text": "Nous voilà rendus aux jésuites,\nAux Mac-Mahon, aux Dupanloup.\nIl va pleuvoir des eaux bénites,\nLes troncs vont faire un argent fou."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a81cdd72-7d65-4bc3-bfcb-6334976e1640",
                                                "sense_id": "3c8c7df7-b889-3c2b-8834-f8a00342f2f7",
                                                "text": "[…] en se donnant des airs de moraliste qui lui allaient aussi bien qu’une chasuble à un pilleur de tronc."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
